# This folder is now both the git root and the place raw source material
# lands, so the ignore rules carry more weight than they used to. Everything
# below is local-only and unbacked, which is the accepted trade for keeping
# 27 MB of originals out of a repo that GitHub Pages serves in full.
#
# Two specific risks make these rules load-bearing:
#   - every .html at the root would be PUBLISHED by Pages if committed
#   - site-checks scans the repo root, and the archived previews fail it
#     (no light-mode lock, em dashes in copy, 56 errors when last run)
# Before any `git add -A`, run `git add -An .` and read what is pending.

# Raw camera drops arrive with a space in the filename, 5-6 MB each. Only the
# resized work-*.jpg derivatives belong in the repo. Matches at any depth, so
# it covers both this folder and img/.
* *.jpg
* *.jpeg
* *.png

# Design studies and superseded previews. Never delete these, just keep them
# out of the repo and out of Pages.
hero-options.html
hero-options-no-photo.html
*-archived.html
Cornerstone-Services-OnePage.html
preview.html
concepts/

# The full-size original of the CTA wood texture, and the reel downloads that
# video/*.mp4 was re-encoded from.
rich-wood-grain-stockcake-original.jpg
reels-source/

# Packaged hand-offs
*.zip

# Scratch and working images
stephen-*.png
*_n.jpg
_rev*.png
_review*.png
.DS_Store

# Local editor/session config. No other site repo tracks this.
.claude/
